WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.670
This song is about what this bird eats — it's a kind of grass that grows in

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:10.679
the middle of the water. And when you sing coco, it's like question and answer:

00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:16.859
I will do the question [singing] Xô, xô meu sabiá

00:00:16.859 --> 00:00:18.859
and you and André, you do the answer. [Continue singing] Xô, xô meu sabiá....

00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:20.859
[Continue singing] Xô, xô meu sabiá....

